# Electron App Resources

Icon files for platform-specific builds:
- icon.ico (Windows, multiple sizes in ICO format) ✓ Created
- icon.icns (macOS, Apple Icon Image format) - Generate with: ./generate-icns.sh
- icons/ directory with PNGs (Linux, multiple sizes: 16x16, 32x32, 48x48, 64x64, 128x128, 256x256, 512x512) ✓ Created
- icon.iconset/ (macOS iconset directory for generating .icns) ✓ Created

To generate icon.icns:
  - On Linux with icnsutils: ./generate-icns.sh
  - On macOS: iconutil -c icns icon.iconset -o icon.icns
  - Or electron-builder can auto-convert from PNG if .icns is not available
